e  capabilities to say we can take the  order  because we have the possibilities in our  companies  sure is a shield for workers for jobs  and for companies and this is  real european solidarity in action and  i'm very glad that portugal is one of  the countries that will receive  support from sure and  it reflects the need  to strengthen europe's social dimension  and protect the dignity of work  and this is why we will soon come  forward with an action plan  on the implementation of the european  pillar of social rights  and i count on the portuguese presidency  we will work strongly together in this  field it will be one of the main pillars  of your presidency i know that is  a common priority we have  ladies and gentlemen  the period we're living in is a very  difficult one  and that is no different here in  portugal as in the rest  of europe and the rest of the world the  people of this  country have shown tremendous  responsibility and resilience  in the way they have come together to  fight the virus  but like everywhere else people are  tired of this fight and they want to  move on  portugal is a country  of great explorers you have a tremendous  history in that  pioneers who never fear to venture into  the unknown  a country that has always sailed in  unchartered  waters  navigators to quote  the great luis de camares  so i can think of no better country to  guide us through the storm  and to set sail to our future  and i look forward to just doing that  with you portugal with your government  with you antonio and the portuguese  presidency  next year abrigada viva europa  [Music]  you

